Z||000000||DavidHenshaw||11-22-2000||11:30 AM||||Just completed a 1,000 mile round trip in my V6 Fastback and average milage was 24.7 mpg. Pretty good for a fun to drive responsive car. Average speed was about 75 to 80 mph.<P>What does the 4 cylinder get on the highway.<P>Dave<P>86 GT<P>||||reg||1
